      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c87a3012ae9339200580f4e6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大和赤骥在出道战展现出优异的表现──",
      "source_fingerprint": "3934252b7e20daac8b86d89a9857739b19a08ca1eaabc6e92c478d3ca294b0b1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1009/storytimeline_501009402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7baba7dadf5292eebfadeb33",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她决定选择参加后冠路线，\n并将下一个目标设为“郁金香赏”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4e9ff1e316b02bead4df152329351de1667aeb8fd5bd701343f9e276f312889",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1009/storytimeline_501009402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca9398f87514d93417d8541a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出道战结束后・想要的是三后冠",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2feb9632b2e25940078e98a74de55a816b5d84ea86e6d5684db077db3f569e7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1009/storytimeline_501009402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bed5bdfe7889a2cd97fe354",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大和赤骥的出道战结束后，\n与伏特加一起登上杂志特辑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5cc3753b0cbab685f1555c909261610cd9f6b0dc3ef4591ee2fbf58bd838a82",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1009/storytimeline_501009403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
