    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d8b7ac738dcc820a511c3d8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "郁金香赏结束后・好的开始",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2c8c03f4e757cbff62aa7d184f2f1e7fd2c2ce7666a0221ebac91c41b27e44c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1009/storytimeline_501009405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:814c753fccb918547c7f9d1e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大和赤骥虽在“郁金香赏”拿到上榜的成绩──",
      "source_fingerprint": "cab5608ea78e1173788c2ec8417ed23744325e8c2d8555ad799e366611efadfe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1009/storytimeline_501009406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:065f932e55627b4480b65ddc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但她因为得不到“第一”而感到不甘心，\n决意要在下次的“樱花赏”获得胜利。",
